    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Tchort is evolution, $(#brother/sister).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тчорт - це еволюція, $(#brother/sister).&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't be scared, the burrowers and coil spiders have been pacified. They can't hurt you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не бійтеся, риючі та павуки-котушки були заспокоєні. Вони не можуть вам нашкодити.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>PI Rista doesn't like people interrupting him, so only enter his office if you must.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Пі Ріста не любить, коли йому перебивають, тому заходьте в його кабінет лише за необхідності.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't go downstairs.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не спускайтеся вниз.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Time to feed the animals!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Час погодувати тварин!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The pacification procedures turned out to be a complete success.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Процедури заспокоєння виявилися повністю успішними.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Working with animals can be a smelly experience. ::Laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Робота з тваринами може бути неприємною. ::Сміється.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>How can I help you $(#brother/sister)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чим я можу вам допомогти $(#брате/сестро)?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I've got a delicious batch of swill ready for our friends. Tasty!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене є смачна партія браги, готова для наших друзів. Смачно!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Tchort guide you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тчорт хай веде тебе.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
